  "prefLabel": "Stra 1106.04 Reimbursement",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1106.04 Reimbursement. Each participating postsecondary institution shall submit its list of scholarship students to the office on or before November 30th and April 30th of each academic year. Within 30 days of each submittal date, the office shall reimburse each participating postsecondary institution for half of the scholarship amount awarded to each student in the applicable academic year.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/stra1100.html"
